{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0819"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/painting","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__painting.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",851],["+"," It was his second great night sky. In September 1888 in Arles he had painted \"Starry Night Over the Rhône\", in which the gaslights of the town shimmer on the water while the seven stars of Ursa Major (the Big Dipper) glitter above the river."],["=",210]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",833],["+"," Es war sein zweiter großer Nachthimmel. Im September 1888 hatte er in Arles die „Sternennacht über der Rhone“ gemalt, auf der sich die Gaslaternen der Stadt im Wasser spiegeln, während über dem Fluss die sieben Sterne des Sternbilds Großer Bär (Großer Wagen) funkeln."],["=",202]]}]},
